From 548d238f18f37a7faa2da78b7739600bd8a85f1b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lotus contributors <build@givelotus.org>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 18:22:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Add optional in-process Core Chronik native host integration

Use the reviewed shared source provider with an explicit BTC host profile. Snapshot spent coins and acceptance time before temporary views are cleared for queued mempool consumers, without changing admission policy. Expose narrow XOR-aware indexed transaction/undo readers. Persist block/undo data and lookup metadata before Chronik commits a connected block; this conservative first implementation flushes once per block. Start before imports/mempool load/networking, interrupt HTTP before owner teardown and drain validation callbacks before stopping the shared subscriber. Chronik remains OFF by default.

